      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Kenneth Kit Lamug (born 1978 in Manila, Philippines) is an American filmmaker, photographer, author and illustrator. He is best known for his children’s picture book \"A Box Story\", co-creator of the independent film \"Vegasland\", and his work on street photography . For his illustrative work, he is also known under the moniker Rabbleboy.",
